5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the calendar slipping. Who can tell us where the delays hide?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I love that we are all here! I am curious about how the rooms are actually used after the work is done.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff doing the daily upkeep are stretched thin and have had no relief.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am concerned about which past projects actually delivered value to the people using them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The budget figures on paper are fiction. I need to see where the real costs hide after the ribbon is cut.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, that is a lovely thought. I am checking the delivery schedules to see where the calendar slips.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, I am looking at the timetable records to see how long rooms stay out of service during construction.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will check the staffing posts since the hiring freeze began.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I will examine the post-occupancy review ratings to see which projects truly satisfied their users.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the tender records over three budget cycles to see how estimates drift from reality.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the weather days in the site diaries. Unplanned rain always steals our precious weeks.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will also check the booking data for specialist and general rooms. I want to see which spaces are truly in demand!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also look at the bench technicians' weekly manual routines. I need to see exactly how much work they carry.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the survey findings in the older blocks. I need to know what structural issues were actually found.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. That is where the hidden costs truly live.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
