75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am ready to vote. Candidate C keeps our calendar safe and our people happy. I trust this choice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I am ready to vote! Candidate C is the clear winner. It keeps our rooms full and our timetables safe. I am so happy for this choice!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
